# Required when testing on a physical device. Restart Metro after changing.
#
# Same WiFi: use your machine's IP, e.g. http://192.168.1.100:3000/api
#   Get IP: ifconfig | grep "inet " (Mac) or ipconfig (Windows)
#
# Expo tunnel / different network: expose backend with ngrok, then use that URL:
#   npx ngrok http 3000  →  set EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://xxx.ngrok-free.app/api
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
